Package: pulzr-storage
Provides: parkeze-storage
Replaces: parkeze-storage
Conflicts: parkeze-storage
Depends: kmod-fs-ext4, kmod-fs-vfat, kmod-nls-cp437, kmod-nls-iso8859-1
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@pulzr.net>
Architecture: all
Description: Removable storage, for the boards that have a slot.
 Mounts the SD card a WisGate ships with and records it in UCI, chosen by
 elimination so that it can never claim the disk the system is running from.
 The card is the only place on a RAK big enough to hold the firmware being
 replaced, which is what makes a local rollback possible there; everything
 else treats it as an optimisation and works without it.
